                "description": "The Coventry Leverset with Regular Rosette is part of Emtek's American Heritage collection. It has a wonderfully traditional style that makes it a great choice for historic homes. The Coventry Lever with Round Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and is available in either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
